:"受けてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信がなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何をやっても中途半端な私が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受かるのかな。って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第1次審査から第5次審査まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の番号が次々に呼ばれていって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合格発表で番号を呼ばれた時は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘じゃないか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな気持ちになったのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に、びっくりしてよく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからなかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで私が受かったのだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今でもわかりません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、こうして乃木坂46という"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グループに入って一年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの経験をしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろなことを学びました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部、初めてでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お見立て会の握手で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて手を握った時。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを始めて、コメントがきた時。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてお手紙、プレゼントを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いただいた時。"